      "title": "executive summary",
      "pills": [{"text": "prose · 184w"}],
      "markdown": "The cluster is broadly ready for **14 → 16**. Of **312 queries**, only **9** hit removed or changed surface — six related to `jsonb_path_*` reordering, two to `regclass` casts, one to a removed `recovery.conf` path. Read traffic is safe to flip behind `pg_session_jwt`. Write traffic needs the new opclass on `events.tags` first.\n\nThe hot path on `orders` regresses **~12%** on planner v16 without an explicit `set enable_partitionwise_join = on`. A blocking **icu collation** drift on `users.email` requires a reindex before cutover; without it sort order silently changes for 0.4% of rows.\n\nRecommended path: **shadow-write** 48h, cut reads under flag, then cut writes during the next maintenance window. Rollback is one-way after WAL diverges; see `rollback.sql`."
